    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Depot is a casual space sim management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unemployed in a utopian future, you've just received a job offer for Depot Manager with ZENCORP Logistics and Distribution. No need for pants. This is a work-from-home position. You'll telecommute 23 billion miles to manage the logistics needs of a small sector of outposts. Each one relies on the system to be functioning for your space depot to thrive and for ZENCORP to realize a future where everyone has what they need.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair solar panels to keep your energy grid functioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive and store materials from outpost in the sector.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage incoming hazardous material, like explosives that have to be stabilized and shipments that need to be decontaminated.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for asteroid fields by purchasing more asteroid blasters to protect your valuable cargo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with outpost to determine their needs, then strategize which outpost orders you are able to fulfill.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your outpost rep and receive rewards such as drone skins, health, battery, and speed upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for choosing ZENCORP to further your employment goals!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Depot is a casual space sim management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unemployed in a utopian future, you've just received a job offer for Depot Manager with ZENCORP Logistics and Distribution. No need for pants. This is a work-from-home position. You'll telecommute 23 billion miles to manage the logistics needs of a small sector of outposts. Each one relies on the system to be functioning for your space depot to thrive and for ZENCORP to realize a future where everyone has what they need.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair solar panels to keep your energy grid functioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive and store materials from outpost in the sector.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage incoming hazardous material, like explosives that have to be stabilized and shipments that need to be decontaminated.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for asteroid fields by purchasing more asteroid blasters to protect your valuable cargo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with outpost to determine their needs, then strategize which outpost orders you are able to fulfill.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your outpost rep and receive rewards such as drone skins, health, battery, and speed upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for choosing ZENCORP to further your employment goals!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
